WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
I need to shift the T down-right and turn it clockwise — I'll test a spread of pushes to find the right touch.

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.467
I've mapped a promising two-step route — I'll execute the first push now to get into position.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:06.033
Eastward pushes cost too much position — I'll try north-south pushes on the tips to get cleaner rotation.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.467
Found a finishing push that should land inside the goal — I'll execute it now.

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.467
Success: 11 px from the goal.
